<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 3.40 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 3.40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 3.40 percent on Tuesday from 3.93 percent on Monday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The bank said nine banks traded on the market in a total of 20 reported transactions.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
